  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut pumpkin into 1 cm-thick wedges. To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with Nan's special seasoning, season with salt and drizzle with olive oil. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer and scrape out the seeds, if necessary!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8c2876038927854113af-f5d790ac.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Roughly chop roasted almonds. Thinly slice kale, discarding any larger pieces of stalk.\n• Thinly slice red radish and cucumber into rounds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8c2876038927854113af-da0cd7aa.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a small bowl.\n• Crumble in fetta cubes and mash to combine.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8c2876038927854113af-5fca10b8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the pumpkin has 5 minutes remaining, in a large bowl, combine cucumber, radish, spinach & rocket mix, kale, a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8c2876038927854113af-75bb394d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave honey mustard sauce until warmed through, 30 seconds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8c2876038927854113af-93b8db39.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide salad between bowls then top with roast pumpkin and haloumi.\n• Drizzle over honey mustard sauce, and garnish with garlic fetta and pecans. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8c2876038927854113af-ab183844.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
